{"lyrics":"[00:04.20](Shoot Through Yo' Car Door, Shout Out To Cardo)\n[00:12.98](Cardo Got Wings)\n[00:29.96]Uh, oh, no-no\n[00:33.66]Too much on my mind, feel like I'm 'bout to overload\n[00:37.36]Life's too hard, I'll take the easy way and overdose\n[00:41.02]Too many ups and downs, this a rollercoast'\n[00:44.90]I was born to drown, I was born hell-bound\n[00:48.44]My back to the world as it all burns down\n[00:52.14]Yeah, my heart was good until I found out ain't no such thing as good anymore\n[01:00.00]Bein' optimistic is a waste of time, uh, one thing about time, you ain't wastin' mine\n[01:06.94]Ain't no savin' me, I know my heart cold, blame it on the weather and the Narcos\n[01:14.26]Take my breath, take my heart, take my soul, nothin' left\n[01:18.06]I got cash, but I can't take that with me after death\n[01:21.66]You can't tell, bitch, I'm stressed, I been feeling like a mess\n[01:25.50]I been feelin' like a wreck, 911, I'm in distress\n[01:30.90]There's a hole in my chest, there ain't nothin' left but I'll try my best to be the best\n[01:44.06]Uh, oh, no-no\n[01:47.50]Too much on my mind, feel like I'm 'bout to overload\n[01:51.20]Life's too hard, I'll take the easy way and overdose\n[01:54.86]Too many ups and downs, this a rollercoast'\n[01:58.74]I was born to drown, I was born hell-bound\n[02:02.28]My back to the world as it all burns down\n[02:05.98]Yeah, my heart was good until I found out ain't no such thing as good anymore","words":[[4.2,4.32,"(Shoot"],[4.36,4.5,"Through"],[4.64,4.74,"Yo'"],[4.8,4.96,"Car"],[5.0,5.14,"Door,"],[6.06,6.26,"Shout"],[6.3,6.38,"Out"],[6.42,6.44,"To"],[6.52,6.92,"Cardo)"],[12.98,13.34,"(Cardo"],[13.48,13.58,"Got"],[13.92,14.76,"Wings)"],[29.96,30.0,"Uh,"],[30.06,30.24,"oh,"],[30.9,32.8,"no-no"],[33.66,33.8,"Too"],[33.88,34.1,"much"],[34.22,34.28,"on"],[34.34,34.48,"my"],[34.56,34.76,"mind,"],[34.8,34.96,"feel"],[35.06,35.28,"like"],[35.32,35.42,"I'm"],[35.48,35.66,"'bout"],[35.74,35.8,"to"],[36.12,36.84,"overload"],[37.